            "review_title": "Review at Kampung Melayu Halal Restaurant Danang",
            "review_text": "Hermanshah\nSingapore, Singapore524 contributions\n0\nServed nice halal food\nOct 2023 • Couples\nFor muslim travellers to Da Nang.. this is 1 out of only 2 halal restaurant here.. if you are staying at Voco,Raddisson or Four points then this restaurant is of 10-15 mins walking distance..i stayed at voco and try walking here on the first day..took me around 15 mins to reach here..i took grab on subsequent visit and it took only 5 min costing only 30000VND..\n\nKampung melayu served variety of dishes from Thai style food to local pho.. the restaurant guys were shy people but served great halal dishes..do support and enjoy meals here..the restaurant looks dated but overall is clean and comfortable..\n\nThe price is reasonable and i would recommend it to others..\nRead more\nWritten October 14, 2023",
